{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-4","kind":"proposition","title":"大小比较：整数","englishTitle":"Any number is either a part or parts of any number, the less of the greater.","book":7,"number":4,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.4","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.4/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":4,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-4@raw-89e79a343d59c4bb","contentId":"euclid-7-4","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89e79a343d59c4bbd5dd20a74d2264c98ee756acb0b2c2628be52210bd1b86f6","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-4.statement","euclid-7-4.construction.1","euclid-7-4.proof.1","euclid-7-4.proof.2","euclid-7-4.proof.3","euclid-7-4.proof.4","euclid-7-4.proof.5","euclid-7-4.proof.6","euclid-7-4.proof.7","euclid-7-4.proof.8","euclid-7-4.conclusion","euclid-7-4.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-4.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-4","revisionId":"euclid-7-4@raw-89e79a343d59c4bb","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea8ef1b47e669e9f8097cd9dc9c0b698362ca09ac341068fe2918b090019cece","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Any number is either a part or parts of any number, the less of the greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何数字都是任何数字的一个或多个部分,较大数量中数量较少。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-4.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-4","revisionId":"euclid-7-4@raw-89e79a343d59c4bb","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7263d5ff8bc6c16ed68ae0c5591424508e88781d0fa82b9c46c249f38f753dba","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, BC be two numbers, and let BC be the less; I say that BC is either a part, or parts, of A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,BC成为两个数字,让BC成为较小的数字;我说,BC要么是A的一部分,要么是其中的一部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-4.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-4","revisionId":"euclid-7-4@raw-89e79a343d59c4bb","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca4daacaf923ad71212d8f1d250ac4a1cb2092ec22c465fb08577bea548e7c4b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For A, BC are either prime to one another or not."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,BC 要么互素 要么不是。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-4.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-4","revisionId":"euclid-7-4@raw-89e79a343d59c4bb","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1977f3ad1e04224f40267251afe696b6640893753b1980e36c000fd177c76f27","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let A, BC be prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让A,BC是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-4.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-4","revisionId":"euclid-7-4@raw-89e79a343d59c4bb","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"21218f86066eb7535e27c28b2e4a2497bcf667f223144a52d5fbd608f107dd6b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, if BC be divided into the units in it, each unit of those in BC will be some part of A; so that BC is parts of A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果BC分解为单位分,BC分中的单位分之一将是A分的一部分;BC分是A分的一部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-4.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-4","revisionId":"euclid-7-4@raw-89e79a343d59c4bb","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8c877231fde35330c6e93b75d03782eda59fcf93912a8721e3f880d1d886a757","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next let A, BC not be prime to one another; then BC either measures, or does not measure, A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"下一位是A,BC不是互素,然后是BC,或者整除,或者不是整除,A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-4.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-4","revisionId":"euclid-7-4@raw-89e79a343d59c4bb","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e0e13661fcaaef7cea060a0324199c63fb5ac6d2aedace9ed430acc155fb5ff3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If now BC measures A, BC is a part of A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果现在BC 整除 A,BC是A的一部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-4.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-4","revisionId":"euclid-7-4@raw-89e79a343d59c4bb","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ffa01c8d6e84b63cb34f28c0f3c60e5304884825971a9d28dea7159b1001bdc5","citations":["euclid-7-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if not, let the greatest common measure D of A, BC be taken; [[VII. 2](/principles/euclid-7-2)] and let BC be divided into the numbers equal to D, namely BE, EF, FC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果不是,则可以使用A、BC中最常用的整除、D;BC可以分为D,即BE、EF、FC；其中所求的量是最大公约数。 [[VII. 2](/principles/euclid-7-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-4.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-4","revisionId":"euclid-7-4@raw-89e79a343d59c4bb","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7c00299a5ba19080807f302f802936718a81e030cac31263e4bb6070588626ec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since D measures A, D is a part of A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,D 整除 A,D是A的一部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-4.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-7-4","revisionId":"euclid-7-4@raw-89e79a343d59c4bb","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f42cfc7dab0147db316900d4837092483d724ce92ffc7a40aa8fe549a740f8a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But D is equal to each of the numbers BE, EF, FC; therefore each of the numbers BE, EF, FC is also a part of A; so that BC is parts of A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但D等于每个数字BE,EF,FC;因此,BE、EF、FC中的每一个人也是A的一部分;所以BC是A的一部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-4.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-4","revisionId":"euclid-7-4@raw-89e79a343d59c4bb","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-4.source","contentId":"euclid-7-4","revisionId":"euclid-7-4@raw-89e79a343d59c4bb","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3c36277305ab439d359be684abceb20fb7a471eb446a224f4e05a3993c6f745e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.4/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.4\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-4:euclid-7-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-4.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"VII. 2"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-20:euclid-7-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-20.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.20","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.20/","sourceLabel":"VII. 4"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-4:euclid-7-2:explicit","id":"euclid-7-2","book":7,"number":2,"kind":"proposition","title":"欧几里得算法：求两个整数的最大公约数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-20:euclid-7-4:explicit","id":"euclid-7-20","book":7,"number":20,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：最小公倍数与比例与整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[